1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:06,789
Turns out, a few everyday foods could be why your hands and feet feel numb, cold, or swollen by the end of the day.

2
00:00:07,109 --> 00:00:16,734
Deli meat is loaded with sodium - a two-ounce serving of turkey packs about 570 milligrams, over a third of your daily limit in one sandwich.

3
00:00:17,054 --> 00:00:19,732
Swap in freshly roasted chicken breast instead.

4
00:00:20,052 --> 00:00:24,809
Fried food raises LDL cholesterol and narrows your arteries over time.

5
00:00:25,129 --> 00:00:28,579
Air-frying or baking at home cuts most of that oil out.

6
00:00:28,899 --> 00:00:34,459
And sugary soda alone is linked to a nearly 20 percent higher heart disease risk.

7
00:00:34,779 --> 00:00:37,724
Swap it for sparkling water with real fruit juice.

8
00:00:38,044 --> 00:00:42,534
Small swaps like these add up to real relief for your circulation.
